OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to protect and improve castle
OL,4,Alandmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly half a million pounds has been
OL,7,Fgranted to develop a plan to protect a
OL,8,Fhistoric landmark in Cornwall.
OL,10,FEnglish Heritage said it wanted to
OL,11,Fconserve and reimagine the Tudor keep
OL,12,Fat Pendennis Castle, described as one
OL,13,Fof Cornwall's most important historic
OL,14,Flandmarks.
OL,16,FThe conservation charity said the
OL,17,F#466,565 grant from the Heritage Fund
OL,18,Fwould be used for essential repairs to
OL,19,Fthe keep and to help shape plans to
OL,20,Ftransform how the castle's story was
OL,21,Fshared with visitors.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
