OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to protect and improve castle
OL,4,Alandmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe money has been awarded for the
OL,7,Fdevelopment phase of the project and
OL,8,FEnglish Heritage said it planned to
OL,9,Fapply for a full grant of #2,392,235 to
OL,10,Fdeliver the completed scheme.
